bound-lock/1 about="Everything a system says about itself lives where nobody can check it: a config, a README, a CI log. topos is one line format for all of it — a signed line with a floor and a ceiling, that any head can fold and any second head can verify. Two implementations agree only on what passes between them, and what passes between them is a line. So the line is the one thing held still; everything else belongs to a world." at=place:topos by=lane-A epoch=1 form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/idea sig="ed25519:era1:RKKTVNwaRgI8AGofQcOjd8hze9Q3DMgW+37FmAPOr105i/zL2U5JQ/j9M9OmFPwOZES+il4yvOjPib45RWCZCg==" value=lock
